# Habitat Detectives

Grade 3 Life Skills lesson resources (ICTC6212/w, Constraint Set B: offline, shared tablets).

- `index.html`: the Engage/Explore artefact (mystery sound, clue files, wonder question)
- `quiz.html`: the Evaluate quiz (diagnostic, matching and higher-order questions with feedback)

No images, frameworks or internet connection are needed. Animals and icons are emoji, and the sounds are made by the page itself.
To use offline, copy this whole folder to a tablet and open `index.html` in the browser.
